{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47302","headline":"步虚词十首 一 · 吴筠","name":"步虚词十首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衆仙仰灵范，肃驾朝神宗。\n金景相照曜，逶迤升太空。\n七玄已高飞，火链生珠宫。\n余庆逮天壤，平和王道融。\n八威清游气，十绝舞祥风。\n使我跻阳源，其来自阴功。\n逍遥太霞上，真鉴靡不通。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47302.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47302","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}